# The API image's build context is the repository root, because it ships the
# server-rendering bundle built from frontend/. Everything a build does not read
# is excluded — the scrape archive alone is 90MB, and a context that large is
# uploaded to the daemon on every build.
.git
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
# `**/dist` does not match this one, and it is 83MB of a previous local build
# that would ride into the build context and into the frontend build stage.
**/dist-dev
# The incremental-build stamp from a local `tsc -b`. Copied in, it makes the
# image's `tsc -b` believe the typecheck is already done and skip it, so a type
# error that fails the build on a laptop passes inside the image.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
_scrape
backups
docs
k8s
ai
**/.env
**/.env.*
*.log
*.docx
*.pdf
*.png
.claude
